{"id":"651657","name":"卤肉鹌鹑蛋卤肉饭","author":"飘零817","authorId":"9420512","desc":"","cover":"images/651657/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"鹌鹑蛋","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"将鹌鹑蛋剥好备用，如果嫌麻烦，可以买现成剥好的。","img":"images/651657/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉切小块先放老抽跟生抽翻炒一下。","img":"images/651657/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加水没过，放入辣椒，八角，香叶，冰糖。","img":"images/651657/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"再放葱。","img":"images/651657/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"小火煮20分钟，勾芡翻拌均匀。","img":"images/651657/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/651657/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"弄两颗青菜装盘，变成了卤肉饭。","img":"images/651657/step_7.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}